   "cooked": "<p>In case you missed the stealth update of the <a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/3-become-a-hatcher/101\">3. 🐣 Become a Hatcher</a> post with these final TEC visual explainers of the 2-phase Hatch process and what the TEC will look like after the Commons Upgrade, I’m dropping them here too.</p>\n<p>Enjoy! <img alt=\":purple_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/purple_heart.png?v=9\" title=\":purple_heart:\"/> <img alt=\":green_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/green_heart.png?v=9\" title=\":green_heart:\"/></p>\n<p>The TEC Hatch in 2 phases:<br/>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c.jpeg\" title=\"TEC 2-phases\"><img alt=\"TEC 2-phases\" data-base62-sha1=\"27l4VOMr6wwSq3XRJhQVtJF84xu\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c_2_10x10.png\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0ed8c1392a505705ecf4ea88301d40f51232ad9c_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">TEC 2-phases</span><span class=\"informations\">2999×1687 592 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n<p>The future TEC:<br/>\n</p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b.jpeg\" title=\"TEC final\"><img alt=\"TEC final\" data-base62-sha1=\"bFnhDD09ZtspHV6dGRN3ek217qH\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b_2_10x10.png\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b_2_690x388.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/51c5406283291bca60e6130291e487c3fdd4092b_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">TEC final</span><span class=\"informations\">3200×1800 669 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>",
